# --- Terraform --- (patrones sin anclar al principio: cubren tanto
# terraform/ como terraform/bootstrap/, cualquier profundidad)
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/*.tfvars
!terraform/terraform.tfvars.example
**/*.tfplan
**/crash.log

# --- Ansible ---
ansible/inventory/hosts.ini
ansible/.vault_pass
ansible/group_vars/vault.yml
!ansible/group_vars/vault.yml.example
ansible/*.retry

# --- General ---
.DS_Store
*.pem
*.log
